  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfSignificantTransactionsNotRequiringUseOfCashOrCashEquivalentsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 16px; text-align: left"&gt;３．　重要な非資金取引の内容&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; line-height: 16px; text-align: left"&gt;　資産除去債務&lt;/p&gt;
